{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sryl4zqx","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":580,"top":254,"width":950,"height":70},"name":"step1detail","text":"排除 2 个直角标记的 4 条笔画、6 个辅助点；保留主体 5 点、5 线。\n按 0.5° 容差筛出 AB⊥AC、EB⊥EC 两组近垂直候选。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
