{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/utg3698n","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":580,"top":382,"width":960,"height":70},"name":"step2detail","text":"以输入坐标为锚点迭代线性化求解，使两组主体边满足 u·v=0。\n保持 D 在 AB、EC 上，并加入全点对长度保护（权重 0.01）。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
