{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hofulsf2","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":580,"top":511,"width":965,"height":70},"name":"step3detail","text":"单点位移≤对角线 0.5%，已有边长变化≤1%，点在线段内顺序不变；\n若冲突或超限，移除较弱候选重解；写回时统一保留 3 位小数。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
